# Implementation of online genetic laboratories by using free resources

**Authors:** Geeta Selvarajah

## Abstract
<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title><jats:p>The COVID‐19 pandemic forced the adoption of online laboratories. The present article discusses the virtual laboratories used by students. The questions posed by students provided targeted teaching opportunities.</jats:p>

